      "value": "Yeah, the one VRchat is using doesn't just look like it simulates not being about to tell the difference between colors but takes away the saturation too.\nAlso not color-blind but colorblind people I've known still seem to experience colors' vibrancy within their visible colors",
      "viewerReactions": null,
