      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noticed this last night.  It's making reds and yellows appear as blue, but to someone with protanopia the color red would appear similar to a dark shade of yellow.  Blues appear as yellow but they should be blue because a person with protanopia can still see the color blue.  It's almost like the effect is swapped?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
